      "content": "<!--\n  Agents — a product landing page: sticky nav, breadcrumb strip, split hero\n  with a node-graph illustration, and a partner logo wall. Drawn at 1280×800.\n  All logos are inline SVG so the page never reaches the network.\n-->\n<div class=\"flex h-[800px] w-[1280px] flex-col overflow-hidden bg-[#FDFCFB] font-sans text-[#1D1D1F] antialiased dark:bg-neutral-950 dark:text-gray-100\">\n  <!-- Header -->\n  <header class=\"w-full shrink-0 bg-[#FDFCFB]/80 backdrop-blur-sm dark:bg-neutral-950/80\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-8\">\n      <div class=\"flex h-16 items-center justify-between\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"text-[#DD795D]\">\n            <path d=\"M12 1.5L14.39 8.61L21.5 10.5L16.25 15.63L17.64 22.5L12 18.77L6.36 22.5L7.75 15.63L2.5 10.5L9.61 8.61L12 1.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n          </svg>\n          <span class=\"text-xl font-medium text-[#1D1D1F] dark:text-gray-100\">Claude</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-6 text-sm font-medium text-[#555555] md:flex dark:text-muted-foreground\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors hover:text-[#1D1D1F] dark:hover:text-gray-100\">\n            Meet Claude\n            <svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\" /></svg>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors hover:text-[#1D1D1F] dark:hover:text-gray-100\">\n            Platform\n            <svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\" /></svg>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors hover:text-[#1D1D1F] dark:hover:text-gray-100\">\n            Solutions\n            <svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\" /></svg>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-[#1D1D1F] dark:hover:text-gray-100\">Pricing</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors hover:text-[#1D1D1F] dark:hover:text-gray-100\">\n            Resources\n            <svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\" /></svg>\n          </a>\n        </nav>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden text-sm font-medium text-[#555555] transition-colors hover:text-[#1D1D1F] sm:inline-block dark:text-muted-foreground dark:hover:text-gray-100\">Login</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"rounded-md border border-[#E5E5E5] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:bg-zinc-100 dark:border-white/15 dark:hover:bg-white/10\">Contact sales</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"rounded-md bg-[#1D1D1F] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-[#FDFCFB] transition-colors hover:bg-zinc-800 dark:bg-white dark:text-neutral-900 dark:hover:bg-gray-200\">Try Claude</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Breadcrumbs -->\n  <div class=\"shrink-0 border-b border-[#E5E5E5] dark:border-white/10\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-8\">\n      <div class=\"flex h-12 items-center justify-between text-sm text-[#555555] dark:text-muted-foreground\">\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"cursor-pointer hover:underline\">Solutions</span> / <span>Agents</span>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n          Explore here\n          <svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\" /></svg>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <main class=\"flex-grow\">\n    <!-- Hero -->\n    <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-8 py-20\">\n      <div class=\"grid items-center gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2\">\n        <div class=\"relative order-last flex justify-center lg:order-first\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" class=\"h-auto w-full max-w-md\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <g class=\"text-[#DD795D]\">\n              <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"60\" r=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n              <circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"60\" r=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n              <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"150\" r=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n              <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"150\" r=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n              <circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"150\" r=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n              <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"240\" r=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n              <circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"240\" r=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n              <path d=\"M140 60 L 60 150 L 140 240 L 200 150 Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" />\n              <path d=\"M260 60 L 200 150 L 260 240 L 340 150 Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" />\n              <line x1=\"140\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"6\" />\n              <line x1=\"140\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"6\" />\n            </g>\n            <path d=\"M90 200 C 80 190, 60 180, 50 190 C 40 200, 40 220, 50 230 C 60 240, 80 250, 90 250 C 100 250, 110 245, 115 240 C 120 235, 125 225, 120 215 C 115 205, 105 205, 100 210 C 95 215, 95 225, 100 230 C 105 235, 115 235, 120 230 C 125 225, 130 215, 125 205 C 120 195, 110 195, 105 200\" stroke=\"currentColor\" class=\"text-[#1D1D1F] dark:text-gray-100\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"text-center lg:text-left\">\n          <h1 class=\"text-balance font-serif text-5xl font-medium leading-tight text-[#1D1D1F] sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl dark:text-gray-100\">\n            Make AI agents <br class=\"hidden lg:block\" /> your unfair advantage\n          </h1>\n          <p class=\"mx-auto mt-6 max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#555555] lg:mx-0 dark:text-muted-foreground\">\n            With Claude, you can build AI agents that plan, act, and collaborate more effectively.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row lg:justify-start\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"min-h-[44px] w-full rounded-lg bg-[#1D1D1F] px-6 py-3 text-base font-medium text-[#FDFCFB] transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-zinc-800 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-zinc-900 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 sm:w-auto dark:bg-white dark:text-neutral-900 dark:hover:bg-gray-200 dark:focus-visible:ring-white dark:focus-visible:ring-offset-neutral-950\">\n              Start building\n            </button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"min-h-[44px] w-full rounded-lg bg-zinc-200/70 px-6 py-3 text-base font-medium text-[#1D1D1F] transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-zinc-200 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-zinc-400 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 sm:w-auto dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-white/15\">\n              Contact sales\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Partner logos -->\n    <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl border-t border-[#E5E5E5] px-8 py-16 dark:border-white/10\">\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 items-center justify-items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-12 text-[#555555] md:grid-cols-4 dark:text-muted-foreground\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 opacity-70 grayscale dark:opacity-80 dark:invert\">\n          <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2L14.09 8.26L20.5 9.5L16.25 13.5L17.18 19.9L12 16.77L6.82 19.9L7.75 13.5L3.5 9.5L9.91 8.26L12 2Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /></svg>\n          <span class=\"text-lg font-bold\">FACTORY</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 opacity-70 grayscale dark:opacity-80 dark:invert\">\n          <svg class=\"h-6 w-auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M3 12L6 15L9 12L6 9L3 12Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /><path d=\"M6 15L9 18L12 15L9 12L6 15Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /><path d=\"M9 12L12 9L15 12L12 15L9 12Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /><path d=\"M12 9L15 6L18 9L15 12L12 9Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /></svg>\n          <span class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Windsurf</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 opacity-70 grayscale dark:opacity-80 dark:invert\">\n          <svg height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M7.083 14.167L2.917 10l4.166-4.167.98.98L4.876 10l3.187 3.187-.98.98zm5.834-8.334L8.75 10l4.167 4.167.98-.98L10.71 10l3.187-3.187-.98-.98z\" /></svg>\n          <span class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">augment code</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 opacity-70 grayscale dark:opacity-80 dark:invert\">\n          <svg height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\" /><path d=\"M12.75 16.5H11.25V12.75H8.25V11.25H11.25V7.5H12.75V11.25H15.75V12.75H12.75V16.5Z\" fill=\"#FDFCFB\" /></svg>\n          <span class=\"text-2xl font-bold italic\">Bito</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</div>\n"
    }
  ]
}
